WEBVTT

00:05.600 --> 00:11.990
JORDAN: Seriously, Alex? I had to finish almost the entire project by myself. You never take anything seriously.

00:14.114 --> 00:15.914
ALEX: What are you talking about? You don't even know what I've been dealing with.

00:16.154 --> 00:17.754
ALEX: I was trying to—

00:17.754 --> 00:20.934
JORDAN: There's always an excuse. Why am I even working with you?

00:27.020 --> 00:29.810
ALEX: Whatever. If that's what you think of me, just do it yourself.

00:41.186 --> 00:48.626
NARRATOR: Communication isn't just about what we say. It's also about how we listen, respond, and understand others.

00:49.496 --> 00:51.326
NARRATOR: Where did this conversation go wrong?
